WEBVTT

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.567
TIME'S UP!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.300
The answer is...

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:09.767
C,

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:10.200
square!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:10.633
One,

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:11.067
five,

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:12.833
and nine are numbers.

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:15.000
A square is a shape,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.200
so it does not belong.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.167
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.767
The answer is...

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:27.167
A,

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:27.933
a square!

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:30.267
The number of sides goes down

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:31.833
by one each step,

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:34.567
so the next shape is the square.

00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:42.500
TIME'S UP!

00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:44.167
The answer is...

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:44.600
B,

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.000
forty-three!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.500
The gaps grow by the same

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.767
amount each step,

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.267
so the next number is forty-three.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:52.133
So,

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:53.933
are you smart or fart?

00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:56.133
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:57.200
find your rank!

00:00:57.733 --> 00:00:58.033
So,

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.267
how did you do?

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:00.500
Comment your score below,

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.733
and follow for more!
